    "scope": "App 1.6.10 (frontend 1.4.15 unchanged): Raum anlernen reads the heating circuits from the VM's own 30-day history (new read-only VM endpoint GET /api/dashboard/v1/circuit-history, sent with the Ingress credential as the administrator who started it; phase from state codes 1 day, 2/3/4 setback; targets from the VM parameter journal) and the room from HA long-term statistics (recorder/statistics_during_period, hourly, up to one year) for the allowance, the recorder history only for the heat-up response (newest first, stops after two empty 12 h pieces, at most 90 days); fallback to the recorder (room and climate entities) when the statistics or the VM are missing, refused, unreachable, older or without known targets, named in the evidence; periods 3/7/14/30/90 days and alles Verfuegbare; evidence names every source and its resolution; accept/discard, warnings, recording fallback, learning file schema and no writes to HA or the VM unchanged. No container build, HA/Supervisor installation, real HA service call or physical acceptance is claimed."
